# R-FS9 v4.9: frozen artefacts must check out byte-identical on
# every platform. outputs/interpretability.json and
# outputs/raw_bn_diagnostic.json are sha256-pinned by the
# battery; a Windows checkout under core.autocrlf=true smudged
# LF->CRLF and failed the interpretability pin on a record whose
# CONTENT was byte-identical to the committed blob (RUNLOG
# v4.9 row). -text disables EOL conversion for the artefact
# trees; the canonical/historical logs under logs/ are equally
# byte-frozen records.
outputs/** -text
logs/** -text
